### Create a farm.
POST /api/farm HTTP/2.0
Host: 127.0.0.1:8080
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "user_id": "00000001",
    "name": "Farm Test A",
    "location": "New York City Center",
    "color_string": "#fff000"
}

### Get farm list.
GET /api/farm/list/00000001 HTTP/2.0
Host: 127.0.0.1:8080
Accept: application/json

### Update farm properties.
PATCH /api/farm HTTP/2.0
Host: 127.0.0.1:8080
Accept: application/json

{
    "farm_id": "0000001",
    "name": "Upated Farm A",
    "location": "Updated New York City",
    "color_string": "#000fff"
}